# Dart (app code)

Follow `.cursor/skills/slow-journey-project/SKILL.md`.

- Do not add `//` or `/* */` comments in new or edited Dart
- Names must be meaningful (classes, functions, variables, files). See `docs/development/naming.md`
- Loop indexes must be descriptive (`slotIndex`, `destinationIndex`); never `i` / `j` / `k`
- Use package imports (`package:slowjourney/...`)
- Keep domain logic in `lib/core/services/*`, not widgets
- Finish only when `flutter analyze` prints **No issues found!**
- Finish only when `flutter test` passes
